671 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 219 0 R
/T (The product slate of Visakh Refinery spans the entire barrel: light ends \(LPG, propylene, naphtha, motor spirit\), middle distillates \(superior kerosene oil, aviation turbine fuel, high-speed diesel, light diesel oil, mineral turpentine oil, jute batching oil\) and heavy ends \(fuel oil, low-sulphur heavy stock, very-low-sulphur fuel oil, bitumen and elemental sulphur\). Following the commissioning of DHDS, DHT and the NHT/CCR/Isom block under VRMP, the refinery is fully equipped to produce BS-VI-compliant motor spirit \(MS\) and high- speed diesel \(HSD\), with sulphur specification limited to 10 ppm\(w\). The commissioning of the RUF has further shifted the refinery's yield structure towards middle distillates, reducing the proportion of low-value fueloil inthe product basket.)
/E (The product slate of Visakh Refinery spans the entire barrel: light ends \(LPG, propylene, naphtha, motor spirit\), middle distillates \(superior kerosene oil, aviation turbine fuel, high-speed diesel, light diesel oil, mineral turpentine oil, jute batching oil\) and heavy ends \(fuel oil, low-sulphur heavy stock, very-low-sulphur fuel oil, bitumen and elemental sulphur\). Following the commissioning of DHDS, DHT and the NHT/CCR/Isom block under VRMP, the refinery is fully equipped to produce BS-VI-compliant motor spirit \(MS\) and high- speed diesel \(HSD\), with sulphur specification limited to 10 ppm\(w\). The commissioning of the RUF has further shifted the refinery's yield structure towards middle distillates, reducing the proportion of low-value fueloil inthe product basket.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
