/E (Advantages: Very high liquid yield with minimal or no solid coke by-product; simultaneous deep hydrodesulphurization, hydrodenitrogenation and hydrodemetallization of the residue, substantially reducing downstream hydrotreating severity; tolerant of very heavy, high-CCR, high-metals feeds through continuous catalyst replacement; produces a product slate directly compatible with BS-VI diesel maximization strategy; long, continuous run lengths between turnarounds.)
