/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 240 0 R
/T (Reactor effluent is separated in high- and low-pressure separator trains, with unreacted hydrogen scrubbed of H2S \(via amine absorption\) and recycled to the reactors, while the liquid product is fractionated into naphtha, diesel/gas- oil range material, resid-derived VGO \(routed to the FCHCU and/or FCC units for further conversion\) and a much- reduced unconverted-oil/fuel-oil stream. Recovered H2S from both the RUF and refinery-wide hydroprocessing units is processed in the Sulphur Recovery Units \(SRU, including the dedicated VRMP SRU trains\) to recover elemental sulphur, a saleable industrial product.)
/E (Reactor effluent is separated in high- and low-pressure separator trains, with unreacted hydrogen scrubbed of H2S \(via amine absorption\) and recycled to the reactors, while the liquid product is fractionated into naphtha, diesel/gas- oil range material, resid-derived VGO \(routed to the FCHCU and/or FCC units for further conversion\) and a much- reduced unconverted-oil/fuel-oil stream. Recovered H2S from both the RUF and refinery-wide hydroprocessing units is processed in the Sulphur Recovery Units \(SRU, including the dedicated VRMP SRU trains\) to recover elemental sulphur, a saleable industrial product.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [5]
>>
