>>
endobj
1511 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 248 0 R
/E (Among these routes, hydrogen-addition technology, and specifically ebullated-bed resid hydrocracking, emerges as the most technically and economically effective option for refiners pursuing simultaneous objectives of maximizing distillate yield, achieving deep sulphur/nitrogen/metals removal, and minimizing solid or heavy by- product )
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
