/Title (Hindustan Petroleum Corporation Limited \(HPCL\) is a Maharatna Central Public Sector Enterprise under the Ministry of Petroleum and Natural Gas, Government of India, and is the second-largest integrated oil refining and marketing company in the country. HPCL's business segments span crude oil refining, marketing of petroleum products \(retail, industrial, aviation and lubricants\), LPG distribution, cross-country pipeline transportation, and an expanding portfolio of petrochemicals, city gas distribution and renewable energy. HPCL holds close to 20% of India's refining market share and operates an extensive marketing infrastructure comprising retail outlets, LPG bottling plants, aviation fuel stations, lube blending plants and cross-country pipelines.)
